		{
			dependencies: ["6E8F257261F93501"]
			description: [
				"This is a rocket that can carry satellites and probes to orbit, but not much else. It is still crucial for researching more advanced space matters."
				""
				"If you want a mission to more far-away places, you will need a probe with built-in thrusters."
