		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6D5E002AE185146E"]
			description: [
				"Your first satellite! You are now on par with all human civilisation in the 1960s! 15,000 years of technological advancement sure is trivial when you have EMI and a quest book!"
				"Anyways, this satellite is nothing special, it only collects orbital data from the planet you send it from."
			]
			id: "64254B39A32BDEA6"
			invisible: true
			subtitle: "Sputnik 1"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5B163F9C0FB000EB"
				item: "kubejs:earth_observation_satellite"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"This is one of your first complicated chemicals! I'm so proud..."
				"Now, the recipe might look scary, but at its root it simply requires basic elements that you most probably already have, like carbon, hydrogen, oxygen, nitrogen and chlorine."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"To somewhat automate this, you will need 2 &6HV&r chemical reactors, 1 &bMV&r chemical reactor and 1 &7LV&r chemical reactor, along with 1 &7LV&r mixer. Of course you can always use higher-tier machines, so feel free to do that if your base is flooded with stainless steel ingots i guess."
			]
			id: "4B45173937DF4ED0"
			subtitle: "The thing that makes rockets GOOOO"
			tasks: [{
				consume_fluid: "FALSE"
				fluid: "gtceu:rocket_fuel"
				fluids: [{
					Amount: 1000
					FluidName: "gtceu:rocket_fuel"
				}]
				id: "0D3B41C3AE04010D"
				type: "ftbq_better_fluids:fluid_plus"
			}]
			title: "Rocket Fuel"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
