			description: [
				"Crewed rockets need something sturdier than just stainless steel, they need something more &oheavy duty&r! Like the &lHeavy-Duty Plate&r!"
				"If you are confused on how to make it, check the last tab of how to make the &oplates&r (not the ingots) and you will find a GC Compressor recipe. That is the intended way to make Heavy-Duty parts."
				""
				"&9Lore&r: You will probably recognise this from Galacticraft. In fact, that is exactly where this comes from!"
